  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>3</mn> </msup> <mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> local extrema if <math><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></msqrt></math> is real i.e., <math><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math>&nbsp;Value of minimum <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
